        "original_id": "ac86afa6-edae-5169-b244-d3e0a2e2831b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Them Crooked Vultures, The Vines\n- People: John Paul Jones, Dave Grohl, Josh Homme\n- Places: Los Angeles, Sydney\n- Awards: Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance\n- Songs: \"New Fang\"\n\nFacts:\n- The Vines are an Australian rock band formed in 1994 in Sydney.\n- Them Crooked Vultures is a rock supergroup formed in Los Angeles in 2009 by John Paul Jones on bass and keyboards, Dave Grohl on drums and backing vocals, and Josh Homme on guitar and vocals.\n- John Paul Jones was formerly a member of Led Zeppelin.\n- Dave Grohl was of Foo Fighters and formerly of Nirvana.\n- Josh Homme was of Queens of the Stone Age and Eagles of Death Metal and formerly of Kyuss.\n- Them Crooked Vultures won the 2011 Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance for \"New Fang\".",
